  "question": "What viewpoint are located within 180 kilometers on the path leading from Monrovia Canyon Park, Monrovia, CA to Peace Awareness Labyrinth and Gardens, Los Angeles, CA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-117.988399 34.176394)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-118.322678 34.032262)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'viewpoint'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-117.988399 34.176394)',4326)::geography, 180000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-117.988399 34.176394)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
